    "summary": "Completed the audited matched LR1e-4 fresh-zero exact-v6 ELO smoke with34,665 physical hands and18,432 new evaluation hands; smaller steps controlled KL but produced the strongest self-family exploit and decisively worse untouched-opponent transfer.",
