    "next_step": "Stop pure fresh-zero self-history scaling. Test a fresh-zero full-network exact-v6 dynamic ELO curriculum seeded with the mature Standard10 strategy plus the exact initial actor, without source KL/imitation. Use LR3e-4 KL-stop (the best transfer arm) and require gains on multiple untouched nontraining anchors, not Standard10 alone."
